OL,3,GNEWSAPublic inquiry over Manchester
OL,4,Asynagogue attack deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public inquiry will examine the
OL,7,Fdeaths of two men killed during an
OL,8,Fattack at a synagogue in Manchester.
OL,10,FMelvin Cravitz, 66, died from multiple
OL,11,Fstab wounds and fellow worshipper
OL,12,FAdrian Daulby, 53, was killed by a
OL,13,Fbullet fired by armed police as he
OL,14,Fblocked the synagogue doors when Jihad
OL,15,FAl-Shamie, 35, tried to get in the
OL,16,FHeaton Park Hebrew Congregation
OL,17,FSynagogue on 2 October 2025.
OL,19,FAnnouncing the inquiry, Home Secretary
OL,20,FShabana Mahmood said: "What happened
OL,21,Fthat day must be fully understood."
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
